stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Hidden
  Hidden --> Loading: Show for the first time
  Loading --> Visible: Valid snapshot with vendors
  Loading --> Empty: Valid snapshot without vendors
  Loading --> Refused: Refusal or malformed snapshot
  Refused --> Loading: Explicit refresh retry
  Visible --> Visible: Select owner or page without a read
  Visible --> Hidden: Hide without a read
  Empty --> Hidden: Hide without a read
  Hidden --> Visible: Show retained snapshot and selection
  Visible --> Loading: Explicit refresh
  Empty --> Loading: Explicit refresh
  Loading --> Visible: Retain existing owner or reset disappeared owner with status
  Loading --> Retired: Session invalidation or disposal
  Visible --> Retired: Session invalidation or disposal
  Retired --> Retired: Ignore late completion
  %% never Local selection, pagination, hide, or show of retained data performs a business read.
  %% never A retired session republishes a snapshot.
  %% never Malformed owners join the missing-owner group.
